OL,3,GNEWSAOysters breeding in firth for
OL,4,Afirst time in more than 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOysters have been found breeding in a
OL,7,FHighland firth for the first time in
OL,8,Fmore than a century, say scientists.
OL,10,FThe molluscs are thought to have been
OL,11,Ffished to extinction in the Dornoch
OL,12,FFirth, north of Inverness, in the late
OL,13,F19th Century.
OL,15,FAbout 300 oysters were moved from Loch
OL,16,FRyan in Dumfries and Galloway in 2017
OL,17,Fas part of the 12-year Dornoch
OL,18,FEnvironmental Enhancement Project
OL,19,F(Deep).
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
