OL,3,GNEWSAOysters breeding in firth for
OL,4,Afirst time in more than 100 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project's team said last month's
OL,7,Fdiscovery of more than 140,000 young
OL,8,Foysters - called spat - confirmed that
OL,9,Fthe shellfish were reproducing.
